2777
02:57:45,110 --> 02:57:45,550
Fuck!

2778
02:57:46,110 --> 02:57:47,070
I could have used...

2779
02:57:48,070 --> 02:57:49,370
the other one!

2780
02:57:50,470 --> 02:57:51,610
Ah, wow!

2781
02:57:54,050 --> 02:57:54,570
Wow!

2782
02:57:56,190 --> 02:57:57,510
God damn it.

2783
02:57:59,930 --> 02:58:01,450
God damn it, man.

2784
02:58:03,570 --> 02:58:04,230
That's... horrible.

2785
02:58:04,510 --> 02:58:05,650
I was just so sure... oops.

2786
02:58:06,070 --> 02:58:09,270
I was so sure all you needed was the hellstone to make the hellstone bar.

2787
02:58:09,770 --> 02:58:11,030
Like any other bar.

2788
02:58:11,850 --> 02:58:12,330
But nope.

2789
02:58:13,150 --> 02:58:14,170
Not this time around.

2790
02:58:14,410 --> 02:58:15,490
