2791
02:58:16,810 --> 02:58:17,810
As much as I can.

2792
02:58:19,530 --> 02:58:20,450
Oh wait, do we have a thingy?

2793
02:58:21,630 --> 02:58:22,930
The blood moon is rising!

2794
02:58:23,730 --> 02:58:24,810
We have a thingy!

2795
02:58:25,870 --> 02:58:26,990
