2796
02:58:28,930 --> 02:58:29,790
Hold on, do this.

2797
02:58:34,050 --> 02:58:35,170
Yeah, none of these actually penetrate.

2798
02:58:36,270 --> 02:58:38,910
That's a bit of a... not great, is it?

2799
02:58:44,760 --> 02:58:46,680
I need a great penetration weapon.

2800
02:58:54,790 --> 02:58:55,810
Get off my lawn!

2801
02:59:01,380 --> 02:59:01,820
Hello.

2802
02:59:02,940 --> 02:59:03,540
Get away.

2803
02:59:04,560 --> 02:59:04,580
What?

2804
02:59:05,580 --> 02:59:06,440
The bride?

2805
02:59:09,510 --> 02:59:09,970
Wait a minute.

2806
02:59:11,190 --> 02:59:12,530
Didn't I kill a groom once?

2807
02:59:13,630 --> 02:59:14,170
That's the groom!

2808
02:59:18,380 --> 02:59:19,400
I got a top hat.

2809
02:59:19,480 --> 02:59:21,440
I think I already got that from the groom last time.

2810
02:59:26,110 --> 02:59:27,090
What the fuck, man?

2811
02:59:29,270 --> 02:59:30,130
This game is crazy.

2812
02:59:32,530 --> 02:59:34,070
Let me just regen some mana here.

2813
02:59:42,560 --> 02:59:45,180
I'm doing so much better against these enemies with this weapon.

2814
02:59:48,000 --> 02:59:49,060
Ah, I got a cloud!

2815
02:59:59,670 --> 03:00:00,710
I'm getting money here.

2816
03:00:02,670 --> 03:00:03,110
Holy shit.

2817
03:00:12,270 --> 03:00:12,590
Nice.

2818
03:00:12,850 --> 03:00:14,210
Wait a minute, is this traveling merchant still here?

2819
03:00:20,980 --> 03:00:22,340
No, he's not.

2820
03:00:23,300 --> 03:00:24,140
Unless he's somewhere else.

2821
03:00:28,820 --> 03:00:29,580
Yeah, I'm not sure.

2822
03:00:31,300 --> 03:00:31,680
What's that?

2823
03:00:33,000 --> 03:00:33,960
Oh, the clown!

2824
03:00:35,180 --> 03:00:36,980
He fucked me up last time.

2825
03:00:37,480 --> 03:00:38,160
Not this time.

2826
03:00:40,740 --> 03:00:41,780
Got him.

2827
03:00:43,880 --> 03:00:44,280
Rossella!

2828
03:00:47,120 --> 03:00:47,620
She's healing.

2829
03:00:48,960 --> 03:00:49,860
Is she healing me as well?

2830
03:00:55,620 --> 03:00:57,040
No, someone died.

2831
03:01:04,080 --> 03:01:04,500
Kill him.

2832
03:01:05,880 --> 03:01:08,180
Dude, this is like fucking home invasion.

2833
03:01:11,650 --> 03:01:12,590
Phew, B and E.

2834
03:01:15,110 --> 03:01:16,250
Forceful KO cannon.

2835
03:01:16,830 --> 03:01:17,670
I got something.

2836
03:01:23,090 --> 03:01:23,810
What's that?

2837
03:01:24,090 --> 03:01:24,310
A zombie.

2838
03:01:25,450 --> 03:01:25,870
What's up, dude?

2839
03:01:27,650 --> 03:01:28,810
Phew, those guys are scary.

2840
03:01:30,270 --> 03:01:32,470
When they piss on you, it's very hard.

2841
03:01:35,070 --> 03:01:37,470
That sentence could be misunderstood.

2842
03:01:39,290 --> 03:01:40,170
In more ways than one.

2843
03:01:45,730 --> 03:01:46,290
Whoop!

2844
03:01:48,250 --> 03:01:48,850
Come on!

2845
03:01:54,030 --> 03:01:54,430
Phew!

2846
03:01:55,710 --> 03:01:57,050
I'm getting better at the combat.

2847
03:01:57,850 --> 03:01:59,590
But maybe it's just me getting a better weapon.

2848
03:02:03,410 --> 03:02:04,850
I feel like I'm also better at dodging.

2849
03:02:10,060 --> 03:02:16,640
But by having a better weapon, you kill enemies faster and thereby there's less enemies, which means it's easier to dodge, so...

2850
03:02:18,400 --> 03:02:19,860
Could just leave some bias there.

2851
03:02:25,750 --> 03:02:27,130
Ah, it's the cloud!

2852
03:02:31,180 --> 03:02:32,460
Dude, I'm doing pretty well here.

2853
03:02:40,370 --> 03:02:41,390
Let me play with this a bit.

2854
03:02:43,870 --> 03:02:44,230
Wow!

2855
03:02:45,110 --> 03:02:45,470
Wow!

2856
03:02:45,970 --> 03:02:46,450
Wait, Mimic?

2857
03:02:48,710 --> 03:02:49,070
Where?

2858
03:02:51,310 --> 03:02:52,430
I didn't even see it.

2859
03:02:52,970 --> 03:02:53,470
Is it invisible?

2860
03:02:55,670 --> 03:02:56,470
Where is it?

2861
03:03:00,480 --> 03:03:01,640
I don't fucking see it.

2862
03:03:07,390 --> 03:03:08,230
Is it right here or something?

2863
03:03:08,910 --> 03:03:08,990
What?

2864
03:03:09,350 --> 03:03:09,350
What?

2865
03:03:09,490 --> 03:03:09,530
What?

2866
03:03:09,610 --> 03:03:09,610
What?

2867
03:03:09,710 --> 03:03:09,710
What?

2868
03:03:09,770 --> 03:03:09,770
What?

2869
03:03:22,850 --> 03:03:23,870
I almost can't see anything.

2870
03:03:32,670 --> 03:03:33,610
I can't hit anything.

2871
03:03:36,350 --> 03:03:37,630
Oh, look how many there are down here.

2872
03:03:43,710 --> 03:03:45,910
Well, the way to beat those clouds is just stay indoors.

2873
03:03:48,290 --> 03:03:49,370
Just like real life.

2874
03:03:59,190 --> 03:04:01,230
Oh, unless the cloud is indoor with you.

2875
03:04:02,390 --> 03:04:03,210
Angry Nimbus.

2876
03:04:07,020 --> 03:04:08,520
Bro, it just occurred to me.

2877
03:04:09,860 --> 03:04:15,580
That's why that thing that Harry Potter rides on is called Nimbus something.

2878
03:04:16,300 --> 03:04:17,720
Because it's like a cloud reference.

2879
03:04:18,000 --> 03:04:19,200
I didn't get that as a child.

2880
03:04:19,400 --> 03:04:20,380
It just hit me.

2881
03:04:21,680 --> 03:04:22,860
That totally makes sense.

2882
03:04:23,520 --> 03:04:25,380
I haven't seen that movie since I was a child, so...

2883
03:04:26,780 --> 03:04:28,300
I remember that very clearly.

2884
03:04:30,820 --> 03:04:33,020
Nimbus 3000 or something was the name of that.

2885
03:04:36,150 --> 03:04:36,990
Bro, when is this stopping?

2886
03:04:42,950 --> 03:04:43,730
Have we not had enough?

2887
03:04:54,070 --> 03:04:54,910
Ah, we've got clouds.

2888
03:04:55,430 --> 03:04:58,030
Oh, man, that thing is killing... Oh, my God!

2889
03:05:11,660 --> 03:05:12,520
Everyone's dying now.

2890
03:05:13,780 --> 03:05:14,400
I must protect.

2891
03:05:20,650 --> 03:05:21,930
Dude, Rossella's healing.

2892
03:05:22,170 --> 03:05:22,590
That's awesome.

2893
03:05:23,630 --> 03:05:24,070
Don't hit me.

2894
03:05:38,090 --> 03:05:39,610
I mean, I'm getting a lot of money out of this.

2895
03:05:42,870 --> 03:05:43,490
There's that.

2896
03:05:47,170 --> 03:05:47,870
Did I do it?

2897
03:06:05,360 --> 03:06:06,080
Ah, nice.

2898
03:06:06,420 --> 03:06:07,600
The 100th Blood Zombie.

2899
03:06:08,300 --> 03:06:08,500
What's this?

2900
03:06:09,440 --> 03:06:10,460
Oh, it's a gravestone.

2901
03:06:17,460 --> 03:06:18,860
I think Dawn is upon us.

2902
03:06:21,580 --> 03:06:22,060
Or maybe not.

2903
03:06:22,200 --> 03:06:23,060
It just kind of looked like it.

2904
03:06:26,410 --> 03:06:27,370
Oh, there's someone behind me.

2905
03:06:40,080 --> 03:06:42,160
Oh, my God, I'm almost dead.

2906
03:06:49,600 --> 03:06:50,940
Oh, is she healing me?

2907
03:06:57,510 --> 03:06:58,550
I think... I'm not sure.

2908
03:06:58,670 --> 03:07:00,530
It could also be the lantern I have hanging.

2909
03:07:01,190 --> 03:07:01,890
No, Rossella!

2910
03:07:05,140 --> 03:07:05,940
Oh, man.

2911
03:07:08,220 --> 03:07:09,240
Right as we ended.

2912
03:07:10,020 --> 03:07:10,380
Incredible.

2913
03:07:12,000 --> 03:07:12,500
Oh, well.

2914
03:07:13,040 --> 03:07:14,200
It is what it is.

2915
03:07:18,100 --> 03:07:19,040
Let's grab all the loot.

2916
03:07:21,100 --> 03:07:22,160
Speaking of loot, I got something.

2917
03:07:23,280 --> 03:07:24,620
Lots of rain hats.

2918
03:07:25,620 --> 03:07:26,320
Fuck them.

2919
03:07:36,090 --> 03:07:37,090
Had to sneeze.

2920
03:07:38,570 --> 03:07:39,470
Get out of here, squirrel.

2921
03:07:41,910 --> 03:07:43,110
Top hat, get rid of it.

2922
03:07:43,870 --> 03:07:44,790
Forceful KO cannon.

2923
03:07:46,030 --> 03:07:47,230
Shoots a boxing glove.

2924
03:07:50,850 --> 03:07:54,590
Wait, is that just like the harpoon?

2925
03:07:54,810 --> 03:07:55,170
It's like...

2926
03:08:01,070 --> 03:08:02,030
Melee damage.

2927
03:08:02,530 --> 03:08:02,530
Okay.

2928
03:08:04,510 --> 03:08:05,150
Well, all right.

2929
03:08:07,350 --> 03:08:07,770
Wedding veil.

2930
03:08:09,810 --> 03:08:11,410
Waf, tu, woof.

2931
03:08:13,290 --> 03:08:13,790
Mavvich.

2932
03:08:14,950 --> 03:08:15,050
Huh.

2933
03:08:22,300 --> 03:08:24,560
Will something happen if I wear the whole wedding set?

2934
03:08:27,100 --> 03:08:27,720
Wait, Ash?

2935
03:08:28,180 --> 03:08:29,020
Doesn't that go in here?

2936
03:08:29,980 --> 03:08:31,520
No, that was mush, I think.

2937
03:08:33,740 --> 03:08:34,340
Delete, delete.

2938
03:08:35,540 --> 03:08:36,420
Delete that.

2939
03:08:43,630 --> 03:08:44,410
We put it in here.

2940
03:08:47,860 --> 03:08:48,380
Like this button.

2941
03:08:49,260 --> 03:08:49,820
Everything goes in.

2942
03:08:50,480 --> 03:08:51,160
Hellfire arrows.

2943
03:08:51,740 --> 03:08:53,080
They go in this box over here.

2944
03:08:54,840 --> 03:08:55,500
Down there.

2945
03:08:58,160 --> 03:08:58,240
Okay.

2946
03:09:00,960 --> 03:09:01,340
Wraith banner.

2947
03:09:01,600 --> 03:09:02,620
Let's get rid of these hats.

2948
03:09:04,440 --> 03:09:05,280
Hello, torch off.

2949
03:09:05,440 --> 03:09:06,360
Wait, are they special?

2950
03:09:08,800 --> 03:09:11,080
Let or Nisa the Dryad.

2951
03:09:11,200 --> 03:09:11,600
We're back.

2952
03:09:14,980 --> 03:09:16,620
Uh, oars?

2953
03:09:18,820 --> 03:09:20,640
This is all vanity stuff?

2954
03:09:21,040 --> 03:09:22,200
Well, that goes in the vanity box.

2955
03:09:24,340 --> 03:09:27,860
This is a melee weapon, weirdly enough.

2956
03:09:29,520 --> 03:09:31,100
Oh, I guess so, because it's a boxing glove.

2957
03:09:34,760 --> 03:09:37,100
I guess that kind of makes...

2958
03:09:37,100 --> 03:09:38,120
Let's try something with these wooden arrows.

2959
03:09:39,960 --> 03:09:42,120
I have these shadow flame bows.

2960
03:09:43,080 --> 03:09:45,060
I just want to see if I can even craft this stuff.

2961
03:09:47,340 --> 03:09:47,400
Jeff?

2962
03:09:48,560 --> 03:09:50,100
Could I possibly...

2963
03:09:50,800 --> 03:09:51,100
Oh!

2964
03:09:55,840 --> 03:09:57,000
It's gotta be here.

2965
03:10:02,680 --> 03:10:03,800
Hellfire unholy.

2966
03:10:05,200 --> 03:10:05,500
Wait, what?

2967
03:10:06,720 --> 03:10:08,380
Shoot shadow flame arrows.

2968
03:10:18,350 --> 03:10:20,410
Well, I guess not.

2969
03:10:24,290 --> 03:10:25,010
Fucking hell.

2970
03:10:27,410 --> 03:10:27,650
Whoops!

2971
03:10:31,670 --> 03:10:32,690
There's no shadow flame.

2972
03:10:33,070 --> 03:10:33,630
Shadow flame.

2973
03:10:36,410 --> 03:10:38,450
I guess I have to find them in the wild.

2974
03:10:39,570 --> 03:10:40,890
That's such a weird bow, though.

2975
03:10:41,310 --> 03:10:41,990
Like, what?

2976
03:10:42,830 --> 03:10:44,090
So where did I even get that bow?

2977
03:10:45,210 --> 03:10:46,850
Did I get it in down below?

2978
03:10:49,050 --> 03:10:52,490
When I say down below, I mean all the way down here, probably.

2979
03:10:54,930 --> 03:10:56,770
Now, is there anything else I want to try and craft?

2980
03:10:58,010 --> 03:10:58,070
Wait!

2981
03:11:02,940 --> 03:11:03,240
Whoops.

2982
03:11:05,480 --> 03:11:06,220
Look at this!

2983
03:11:08,220 --> 03:11:09,500
It's reached here.

2984
03:11:10,860 --> 03:11:12,200
It hasn't reached water yet.

2985
03:11:12,260 --> 03:11:13,440
Let's just pay attention to that.

2986
03:11:14,160 --> 03:11:14,860
And also here.

2987
03:11:16,180 --> 03:11:17,720
This isn't going any further!

2988
03:11:19,640 --> 03:11:23,760
So it seems the living wood is sort of holding this back.

2989
03:11:26,720 --> 03:11:27,960
That's... kind of makes sense.

2990
03:11:29,060 --> 03:11:31,800
My God, I get such a fright when the stars fall from the sky.

2991
03:11:34,580 --> 03:11:37,220
That's actually one reason not to wear this fucking cape.

2992
03:11:37,460 --> 03:11:39,940
I hate that effect so much.

2993
03:11:41,660 --> 03:11:43,500
Like, the smallest thing hits you.

2994
03:11:43,560 --> 03:11:44,620
You hit a thorn bush.

2995
03:11:45,720 --> 03:11:50,180
And the fucking wrath of the heavens come crashing down and you're like, Whoa!

2996
03:11:50,340 --> 03:11:50,700
What happened?

2997
03:11:51,600 --> 03:11:52,440
Oh, it's just a thorn?

2998
03:11:53,080 --> 03:11:53,580
I see.

2999
03:11:55,500 --> 03:11:56,520
Like, come on.

3000
03:11:57,380 --> 03:11:59,540
Can I have a cloak without that effect, please?

3001
03:11:59,920 --> 03:12:01,480
Because I still want to look kind of dapper, you know?

3002
03:12:02,620 --> 03:12:05,540
All right, let's grab the ore and make the rest of the titanium.

3003
03:12:08,560 --> 03:12:09,260
Titanium, titanium.

3004
03:12:10,240 --> 03:12:10,600
There.

3005
03:12:13,990 --> 03:12:14,270
Make it.

3006
03:12:17,510 --> 03:12:17,870
Now!

3007
03:12:19,990 --> 03:12:20,690
Are you ready, kids?

3008
03:12:22,510 --> 03:12:23,230
Titanium leggings.

3009
03:12:24,710 --> 03:12:25,450
That's the one I'm missing.

3010
03:12:27,230 --> 03:12:27,590
Oh!

3011
03:12:31,220 --> 03:12:31,580
Whoa!

3012
03:12:32,080 --> 03:12:35,580
Attacking generates a defensive barrier of titanium shards.

3013
03:12:44,450 --> 03:12:44,810
Wait a minute.

3014
03:12:49,160 --> 03:12:53,120
Why do these not give...

3015
03:12:53,120 --> 03:12:53,780
...magic stuff?

3016
03:13:01,980 --> 03:13:03,100
I mean, nice, I guess.

3017
03:13:03,680 --> 03:13:04,860
I guess I'll find out what that means.

3018
03:13:07,280 --> 03:13:07,860
Where is it?

3019
03:13:09,220 --> 03:13:10,960
Maybe you need to hit something for that to work.

3020
03:13:16,650 --> 03:13:18,050
Man, where are the enemies when you need them?

3021
03:13:20,650 --> 03:13:22,370
Now the world is devoid of enemies.

3022
03:13:25,190 --> 03:13:25,550
Oh, wait.

3023
03:13:25,770 --> 03:13:26,070
Use this.

3024
03:13:28,650 --> 03:13:29,450
There should be enemies here.

3025
03:13:33,000 --> 03:13:33,440
Come on, enemies.

3026
03:13:34,480 --> 03:13:35,320
I'm in your territory.

3027
03:13:40,840 --> 03:13:42,000
There's nobody here now.

3028
03:13:42,880 --> 03:13:43,860
What the f...

3029
03:13:43,860 --> 03:13:45,960
This game sometimes is trolling me.

3030
03:13:47,440 --> 03:13:48,480
There's no enemies.

3031
03:13:50,860 --> 03:13:51,220
Come on.

3032
03:13:58,590 --> 03:13:59,170
There's one.

3033
03:14:03,850 --> 03:14:04,370
Aha!

3034
03:14:06,190 --> 03:14:07,150
Look at that!

3035
03:14:09,630 --> 03:14:12,350
Imagine if they absorb a whole hit, no matter the damage.

3036
03:14:12,550 --> 03:14:13,110
Let's try.

3037
03:14:13,530 --> 03:14:14,490
Oh wait, I have to kill something for it.

3038
03:14:14,550 --> 03:14:15,470
They don't last forever, it seems.

3039
03:14:17,090 --> 03:14:17,430
Goddammit.

3040
03:14:17,930 --> 03:14:18,430
Okay, so now...

3041
03:14:21,350 --> 03:14:22,050
Uh, okay.

3042
03:14:23,310 --> 03:14:23,650
Huh.

3043
03:14:25,970 --> 03:14:27,910
Alright, I'm not sure how good that is.

3044
03:14:28,070 --> 03:14:29,890
It doesn't really block anything.

3045
03:14:33,400 --> 03:14:35,160
